'''Shakurel Tiger''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]] and the [[Catclaw Dojo]]. It was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Shakurel Tiger
|image = E 474.png
|appearance = [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]]<br>
[[Arena of Honor/Attack of the Shakurels|Attack of the Shakurels]]
|money drop = 250¢ - 987¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is not very difficult unless you are a beginner in Battle Cats, to which he can pose a threat. This is mostly because of the low damage, range and moderate health.

==Strategy==
For your first encounter, you just need to spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]]s and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cats]].

